{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vuejs/core/issues/11821","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vuejs/core","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vuejs/core/issues/11821/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vuejs/core/issues/11821/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vuejs/core/issues/11821/events","html_url":"https://github.com/vuejs/core/issues/11821","id":2506945000,"node_id":"I_kwDOCCum186VbPHo","number":11821,"title":"`DetailsHTMLAttributes` should have optional `name` property in jsx","user":{"login":"comfuture","id":151300,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1MTMwMA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/151300?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/comfuture","html_url":"https://github.com/comfuture","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/comfuture/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/comfuture/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/comfuture/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/comfuture/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/comfuture/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/comfuture/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/comfuture/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/comfuture/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/comfuture/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":962500786,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw5NjI1MDA3ODY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vuejs/core/labels/:lady_beetle:%20%20bug","name":":lady_beetle:  bug","color":"fcba03","default":false,"description":"Something isn't working"},{"id":1971465428,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxOTcxNDY1NDI4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vuejs/core/labels/scope:%20types","name":"scope: types","color":"0366d6","default":false,"description":""}],"state":"closed","locked":true,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2024-09-05T07:03:09Z","updated_at":"2024-09-20T00:24:00Z","closed_at":"2024-09-05T09:53:06Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Vue version\n\nlatest\n\n### Link to minimal reproduction\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a274be7b-aeff-42b0-ae9a-03fabf1fbb33\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Create a Vue component with TSX.\r\n1. Add a `<details>` element and assign a `[name]` attribute (e.g., `<details name=\"example\">`).\r\n1. Observe that the `[name]` attribute is flagged as an error by the language server, despite being valid in HTML5.\n\n### What is expected?\n\nThe `[name]` attribute should be recognized as valid for the `<details>` element, and no error should be flagged.\n\n### What is actually happening?\n\n<img width=\"543\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a274be7b-aeff-42b0-ae9a-03fabf1fbb33\">\r\n\r\nWhen using the `<details>` element in a Vue component written in TSX, the `[name]` attribute is valid according to HTML5 specs. However, due to the defined interface, the language server incorrectly flags this as an error and displays a red underline.\r\n\r\nin https://github.com/vuejs/core/blob/main/packages/runtime-dom/src/jsx.ts#L407-L410\r\n```ts\r\nexport interface DetailsHTMLAttributes extends HTMLAttributes {\r\n  open?: Booleanish\r\n  onToggle?: (payload: ToggleEvent) => void\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nAccording to the [MDN Web Docs](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Element/details#multiple_named_disclosure_boxes), the `[name]` attribute is explicitly valid for the `<details>` element in HTML5. It allows for multiple named disclosure boxes to interact within a form, making this a crucial feature that should not be incorrectly flagged.\n\n### System Info\n\n_No response_\n\n### Any additional comments?\n\n_No response_","closed_by":{"login":"yyx990803","id":499550,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5OTU1MA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/499550?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yyx990803","html_url":"https://github.com/yyx990803","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yyx990803/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yyx990803/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yyx990803/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yyx990803/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yyx990803/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yyx990803/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yyx990803/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yyx990803/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yyx990803/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vuejs/core/issues/11821/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vuejs/core/issues/11821/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}